.DS_Store

# Generated SKILL.md files — source of truth is SKILL.md.tmpl
**/SKILL.md

# Per-developer dogfood install of smriti's coding principles. The @-line in
# this file resolves to the developer's local smriti install path (e.g.,
# ~/dev/smriti/lib/resolvers/principles.md), which is machine-specific. Each
# developer runs `smriti-principles-install` locally to generate it.
# Anchored to repo root so a fixture or sub-dir named CLAUDE.md isn't ignored.
/CLAUDE.md

# Machine-local Claude Code settings (per-developer permissions, env, hooks).
# Never commit — it's specific to one machine and may hold local paths.
.claude/settings.local.json
